# Keeps public/ in git even while it holds no assets yet.
#
# next build --output standalone deliberately leaves public/ and .next/static out of the
# standalone bundle, so the Dockerfile copies both by hand. Git does not track empty
# directories, so without this file the folder never reaches the build context and the
# image build dies on `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`.
#
# Delete this once there is a real asset in here.
